Package: acccheck
Version: 0.2.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: perl, samba, curl, sed
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://labs.portcullis.co.uk/tools/acccheck/
Description: SMB account enumeration and password guessing tool
 acccheck is a Perl script that attempts to enumerate SMB user
 accounts and test passwords against them using the SMB protocol.
 Useful for security audits and penetration testing.
